  "spatial_interpretation": "Two column rows. Smooth glossy cream end columns with green bases and stainless foot rings. Eight authored central carved tree columns, sculptural bronze birds and amber capital rings. Pale slatted side soffits; raised central ceiling with pale green cove. Cream/green track-wall panels, black granite plinth; raspberry plants and bronze station name in central wall band. Stairs and lift recesses at both ends. Counts, hidden sides and metric architectural dimensions inferred proportionally; Station Base rail/platform datum retained."
